> SELECT a FROM oou_t ORDER BY a USING ~~~
ERROR 42809: operator ~~~ is not a valid ordering operator (at 38)
HINT: Ordering operators must be "<" or ">" members of btree operator families.

> SELECT string_agg(a::text, ',' ORDER BY a USING <<<) FROM oou_t
string_agg:text
5,4,3,2,1
-- SELECT 1

